OL,3,GNEWSABus driver faces no further action
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver who was arrested after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian died in a collision will
OL,8,Fface no further action.
OL,10,FA woman aged in her 50s was pronounced
OL,11,Fdead at the scene of the crash in
OL,12,FCoxford Road, Southampton, on 8
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FA 54-year-old man from Whiteley was
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of drink driving
OL,17,Fand drug driving, but is no longer
OL,18,Fbeing investigated, Hampshire Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
